  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kanybek Maize Milling Production Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to improve Kanybeks capacity through construction of store to improve storage capacity; procurement of maize milling equipment to improve production capacity, procurement of lorry to improve efficiency and effectiveness in products delivery, provision of crop funds to increase volume of raw maize purchased from farmers</narrative>
